{id:"global_composition",family:"shared",tags:["composition","widescreen","text","caption","logo","watermark","motion","transition"],text:"CSV contract: timestamp, narration, background, hand-drawn characters/props, on-screen text and transitions/motion are distinct fields. The still uses one narration-grounded moment with its setting and props. Timecodes and edit cues are metadata, not things to draw. Use the requested aspect ratio (default 16:9), central safe area, one focal point; no text, logos, watermarks, UI or borders."},
