{id:"character_environment",family:"character_environment",tags:["character_environment","character","host","room","living","cafe","bar","office","street","setting","background","shelf","plant","kitchen","phone","pocket"],text:"Character environment: one readable action in a specified living room, cafe, bar, kitchen, office, city or street. Use listed props only. Warm cream, yellow/ochre, amber, brown, muted green and charcoal recur; daylight may introduce blue. Layered settings can have furniture, shelves, windows, plants and lamps."},
