{id:"anatomy_insert",family:"anatomy_insert",tags:["anatomy_insert","anatomy","organ","liver","heart","body","health","nerve","brain","vessel","blood","cell","fainting"],text:"Anatomy insert: relevant organ/body mechanism as focal point; simplified recognizable educational drawing, thick ink contours, warm coral/orange/brown and muted yellow. Keep accurate to narration and non-graphic; no invented labels or diagnoses."},
{id:"concept_metaphor",family:"concept_metaphor",tags:["concept_metaphor","metaphor","analogy","mechanism","phone","vibration","brain","prediction","wheel"],text:"Concept metaphor: one concrete, legible analogy grounded in the script. Keep it visibly illustrative and do not imply unsupported medical facts."},
