{id:"single_action_vignette",family:"single_action_vignette",tags:["single_action_vignette","action","man","woman","touch","pull","sneeze","cough","faint","walk","sit","stand","pain","stove"],text:"Single action: one frozen readable pose with few props. Do not combine before/after states or multiple cuts in one frame."},
